25884: @shot hole1-holed-out

# The frames after this point in the played run go on to HOLE 2 (the run reaches 'HOLE2 PAR3' by
# f29600). They are cut here: this recipe's claim is one hole, and a longer replay costs the
# conformance suite time it buys nothing with.
